From f6557e0d6f291bba5e28eeba68b40fee67f8a7c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: erikallankincaid <ErikAllanKincaid@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:56:16 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] input: touchpad tap-to-click (--touchpad-tap)

A touch of at most 200 ms that moves less than 1/40 of the pad and presses no physical button is a click: one finger left, two fingers right, three fingers middle (from the BTN_TOOL_* state). With the option on, BTN_TOOL_DOUBLETAP and TRIPLETAP no longer send a middle button press. Off by default. test_touchpad_tap feeds synthetic touchpad events through the pointer code.
---
